777 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The JIL Church is a singing church. From the start, we were taught by Bro. Eddie what the Bible says in Psalms 22:3 "God inhabits the praises of His people", and as lovers of His presence, we never cease singing, dancing, and shouting His praise whenever we gather and feel His indwelling among us. We have praise and worship to start almost every activity in the church. It has been and will always be our trademark: a worshipping church.)
/E (The JIL Church is a singing church. From the start, we were taught by Bro. Eddie what the Bible says in Psalms 22:3 "God inhabits the praises of His people", and as lovers of His presence, we never cease singing, dancing, and shouting His praise whenever we gather and feel His indwelling among us. We have praise and worship to start almost every activity in the church. It has been and will always be our trademark: a worshipping church.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
